---
import TestimonialCard from "./TestimonialCard.astro";
import sarahPhoto from "../images/testimonials/sarah.jpg";
import danielPhoto from "../images/testimonials/daniel.jpg";
import lexiPhoto from "../images/testimonials/lexi.jpg";

export interface Props {
  class?: string;
}

const { class: className } = Astro.props;
---

<div class:list={[className, "flex flex-col gap-12"]}>
  <TestimonialCard
    author="Daniel Azocar"
    photo={danielPhoto}
    job="Living Security"
  >
    <p>
      Andy is an excellent person to work with, <strong
        >always willing to share his knowledge and help others.</strong
      > He is a master at finding elegant solutions, it was a pleasure to work with
      him.
    </p>
  </TestimonialCard>

  <TestimonialCard author="Lexi Mitsuhashi" photo={lexiPhoto} job="CyberGRX">
    <p>
      Andy was a game-changer when he joined our team. He has an exceptional
      UX/UI background that coupled powerfully with his engineering skills.
      While completing all of his direct responsibilities with gusto, <strong
        >he also made enormous contributions to our design language efforts and
        established new working norms that propelled the UX:Engineering workflow
        forward.</strong
      > As a growth stage company, the value that he provided here cannot be overstated.
      Unpromoted, Andy provided strategic business value to our company.
    </p>
    <p>
      Andy is also an absolute joy to work with. He is all smiles and ambition
      on morning standups and <strong
        >someone you want leading your team when tackling large problems.</strong
      > He will brighten the room, virtual or IRL.
    </p>
  </TestimonialCard>

  <TestimonialCard author="Sarah Wolfsont" photo={sarahPhoto} job="IHS Markit">
    <p>
      I've worked closely with Andy for over 2 years in teams big and small. He
      is an inventive problem-solver who thoughtfully balances user needs with
      technical constraints. <strong
        >Andy's skills come together in the magical space between design and
        execution;</strong
      > he gets how to make a design both real and elegant. I look forward to working
      with him again in the future.
    </p>
  </TestimonialCard>
</div>
